content Build tooling for deep single-coin analysis.
	
	## Goal
	Create detailed diagnostic output for analyzing a single coin's behavior.
	
	## Diagnostic Output
	- Tick-by-tick signal log with all intermediate values
	- Spread/deviation time series plot
	- Trade entry/exit markers on price chart
	- Inventory over time
	- P&L attribution (which trades made/lost money?)
	
	## Implementation
	- Add -diagnostic flag to cmd/spread
	- Output JSON event stream for post-processing
	- Build ASCII chart renderer (like cmd/chart)
	- Create summary statistics
	
	## Usage
	go run ./cmd/spread -backtest chaos -symbol ZEC -diagnostic > zec.json
